{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0552_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0552_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "8b5f382597b89f634b826f318617ee2ac9c9e19580a08a073963157b2a33348e", "ja": "{$P$}……グッドモーニングです。\n実はオールナイトで、次のコス……。", "zh": "{$P$}……Good morning。\n其实我通宵在准备下一个Cos……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
