{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0552_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0552_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "ab32f4afbadce32745cf61f8ca0dc78fb1ecdc109d9d09f60850d036f6aaceb4", "ja": "それじゃ{$P$}、\nロコは大事なレッスンだから、行きますね……！", "zh": "那么，{$P$}，\n因为ROCO是很重要的练习，我先走啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0552_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0552_1007_p", "source_sha256": "67885d3b52449b75250d7c190f24b4885757f1c2ed7204ce62b5f54a0b1e71dd", "ja": "ああ。公演も近いけど、あまり無理するなよ。", "zh": "啊。公演也快到了，但别太勉强自己。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
